[CENTER][B][SIZE=7][COLOR=DeepSkyBlue]Phoenix[/COLOR] [COLOR=Red]Kernel[/COLOR][/SIZE][/B]
Phoenix -Kernel For AlcateI POP C1, Alcatel POP C2 and Alcatel POP C3
[B]4015-4032-4033[/B]

[CODE]/*
* I am not responsible for bricked devices, dead SD cards, thermonuclear
