[QUOTE]
[COLOR=Red][B][SIZE=3]Features[/SIZE][/B][/COLOR]
[LIST]
[*]Based on the STOCK Source OT_4015D_20140610.tar.xz from [URL='https://downloads.sourceforge.net/project/alcatel/OT_4015D_20140610.tar.xz?r=https%3A%2F%2Fsourceforge.net%2Fprojects%2Falcatel%2Ffiles%2F&ts=1484438082&use_mirror=ufpr']ALCATEL[/URL]
[*][B]Toolchain[/B]: Built with GCC 5.2 toolchain from [URL='http://www.mediafire.com/file/g05mugw8j403658/arm-cortex-linux-gnueabi-linaro_5.2-2015.11-2-build_2016_01_30.tar.xz']LINARO[/URL]
[*][B]Linux[/B]: 3.4.5
[*][B]CPU OC[/B]: up to 1.4GHz
[COLOR=Blue][*][B]ThunderSonic Sound Control Engine[/B]
[*][B]ThunderCharge Fast Charge Driver[/B][/COLOR]
[COLOR=Red][*][B]ThunderQuake Engine 1.0 - Vibration Intensity Controller for MTK vibrators[/B][/COLOR]
[*][B]Swap[/B]
[*][B]KSM[/B]: Kernel Same-page Merging enabled
[*][B]Dynamic management of dirty page writeback[/B]
[*][B]Dynamic Fsync[/B]: Faux123's Dynamic File Sync v1.5
[*][B]Sweep2wake[/B]
[*][B]Doubletap2wake[/B]
[*]Lowered swappiness (60 -> 70)
[*]Optimized [B]AES[/B] and [B]SHA1[/B] routines for ARM cpu architecture
[*]Optimized [B]SLUB[/B] memory allocator
[*]Enabled arch power
[*]Disabled CRC check in MMC for 30% extra performance with IO
[*]block: Added SIO IOScheduler
[*]block: Add BFQ IOScheduler
[*]block: Add fiops scheduler
[*]Disabled Gentle fair sleepers
[*]NOATIME and NODIRATIME
[*]Dynamic management of dirty page writebacks
[*][B]Mali:[/B] GPU cache Optimizations
[*][B]Mali:[/B] Increase L2 cache max read size
[*][B]Mali:[/B] Disable state tracking
[*][B]Mali:[/B] Reduce GPU utilization timeout
[*][B]Mali:[/B] increase kernel memory buffer size
[*][B]Additional Governors[/B]:
         - SmartassV2
[*][B]Additional I/O Schedulers[/B]:
       - NOOP
       - BFQ
       - FIOPS (by default)
       - SIO (SImple Ondemand)
[LIST]
[*]
[/LIST]
[/LIST]
[/QUOTE]

[B][SIZE=4]The REQUIREMENTS[/SIZE][/B]
[LIST]
[*]Custom Recovery CWM/PHILZ/TWRP
[*]A brain with the ability to read
[*]The will to recycle your warranty papers
[/LIST]

